# Citation metadata for this repository (https://citation-file-format.github.io).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "ColemanIntegralsLocalFields: Magma code for explicit Coleman integration over finite extensions of Q_p"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yulin
    family-names: Cai
  - given-names: Timo
    family-names: Keller
repository-code: "https://github.com/TimoKellerMath/ColemanIntegralsLocalFields"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Magma implementation of explicit Coleman integration on smooth projective curves with
  good reduction over finite extensions of Q_p, allowing both ramification and nontrivial
  residue degree, with certified output precision, and of Chabauty-Coleman and symmetric
  Chabauty computations over number fields.
keywords:
  - Coleman integration
  - p-adic integration
  - Chabauty-Coleman method
  - rational points on curves over number fields
  - Magma
preferred-citation:
